      'The second greatest joy for me is that farmers have begun to recognise the importance of organic carbon! For the past six years, we have been making continuous efforts to make farmers understand the importance of organic carbon!',
      'If organic carbon increases by 2%...95% of farming problems are solved.',
      'Now, the next question is how to increase it.',
      'You understand a scientific fact that just as we keep our valuable items in a safe place and lock them in a locker for safety... similarly, nature also secures its important raw materials. With the help of raw material bonding!',
      'For example, the minerals extracted from the ocean produce petrol, diesel, kerosene, and tar needed to make roads. You might be surprised that synthetic sugars are made from them, which are used in many food items.',
      "This example is given to make it easy for you to understand, such as sugar in tar used to make roads... we can't eat simple tar, but household waste or food waste is a significant source of carbon, but it lacks oxygen, so it is not available to trees.",
